# Working examples for the API. Load in VS Code (REST Client) or IntelliJ (HTTP Client).
# The backend runs on :8081 in dev; the SPA proxy also forwards /api there.
@host = http://localhost:8081

### Walking-skeleton page data: seeded policies (public)
GET {{host}}/api/policies

### FNOL — file a claim (CLAIMANT only, 401 without a token)
# Auth: the SPA signs the user in via Keycloak (authorization-code + PKCE, public client
# "claims-frontend", realm "claims", http://localhost:8090). There is no password grant,
# so for ad-hoc requests grab an access token from a browser session on http://localhost:4200
# (DevTools -> Network -> any /api/claims request -> Authorization header) and paste it below.
# @token = <paste access token here>
POST {{host}}/api/claims
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----ApiHttpBoundary

------ApiHttpBoundary\r
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="policyNumber"\r
\r
POL-10001\r
------ApiHttpBoundary\r
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="holderName"\r
\r
Ada Lovelace\r
------ApiHttpBoundary\r
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="holderEmail"\r
\r
ada.lovelace@example.test\r
------ApiHttpBoundary\r
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="lossDate"\r
\r
2026-09-06\r
------ApiHttpBoundary\r
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="lossLocation"\r
\r
London\r
------ApiHttpBoundary\r
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="lossDescription"\r
\r
Kitchen flooded after a pipe burst.\r
# (photos are optional — add a part like the text ones above, name "photos", to upload)
------ApiHttpBoundary--\r

### Adjuster queue — own claims (ADJUSTER_L1/L2) or the whole team (SUPERVISOR)
# Auth: access token from an adjuster/supervisor session (browser DevTools -> any
# /api/queue request -> Authorization header), pasted as {{token}} above.
GET {{host}}/api/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Claimant status — own claim only (CLAIMANT; someone else's claim is a 404)
GET {{host}}/api/claims/CLM-000001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Internal full view — policy + coverage + reserve + notes + photos
# (assigned adjuster or SUPERVISOR only; anyone else gets a 404)
GET {{host}}/api/claims/CLM-000001/full
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Set/update the reserve (assigned adjuster or SUPERVISOR)
PUT {{host}}/api/claims/CLM-000001/reserve
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 1500.00 }

### Add an internal note (assigned adjuster or SUPERVISOR)
POST {{host}}/api/claims/CLM-000001/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Coverage confirmed; awaiting builder quote." }

### Download a photo attachment (assigned adjuster or SUPERVISOR; served as an attachment)
GET {{host}}/api/claims/CLM-000001/attachments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
